  "id": "autonomous",
  "term": "autonomous",
  "definition": "In this context, autonomous means able to navigate and control movement on its own rather than being directly driven by the user. The term describes a system, such as a wheelchair, whose built-in motion control affects how safe, reliable, and usable it feels to people.",
